#: ../plugin/contents/ui/page/SettingPage.qml:180
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info render resolution help text"
msgid ""
"Draws the wallpaper smaller and lets the desktop scale it up. Almost all of "
"a scene's cost is per-pixel, so 50% is roughly a quarter of the GPU work — "
"the largest saving available on a heavy wallpaper, at the price of a softer "
"picture. Changing this reloads the wallpaper."
msgstr ""

