msgid ""
"<ol><li><i>Wallpaper Engine</i> installed on Steam</li><li>Subscribe to some "
"wallpapers on the Workshop</li><li>Select the <i>steamlibrary</i> folder on "
"the Wallpapers tab of this plugin<ul><li>The <i>steamlibrary</i> which "
"contains the <i>steamapps</i> folder<ul><li>This is usually <i>~/.local/"
"share/Steam</i> by default</li></ul></li><li><i>Wallpaper Engine</i> needs "
"to be installed in this <i>steamlibrary</i></li></ul></li></ol>"
